WEBVTT

00:12.800 --> 00:18.884
My role would be serving the customers every day

00:18.884 --> 00:24.909
Always putting the customers first is what they say

00:24.909 --> 00:31.021
I've worked for this firm almost my whole career now

00:31.021 --> 00:36.475
But I am finding that it is getting boring somehow

00:36.475 --> 00:39.815
So I am gonna break away and stand!

00:39.815 --> 00:43.192
Gotta give it a try and take command!

00:43.192 --> 00:46.598
What that means is I am taking the wheel!

00:46.598 --> 00:51.637
Making my dream into something so real!

00:51.637 --> 00:58.286
She is really demanding so it is been stressful lately

00:58.286 --> 01:03.948
I need some time just lying on a beach greatly

01:03.948 --> 01:08.568
Doing absolutely nothing and just forgetting it all

01:08.568 --> 01:14.268
But instead I will answer this loud inner call

01:14.268 --> 01:17.347
So I am gonna break away and stand!

01:17.347 --> 01:20.417
Gotta give it a try and take command!

01:20.417 --> 01:24.056
What that means is I am taking the wheel!

01:24.056 --> 01:53.522
Making my dream into something so real!

01:53.522 --> 01:59.521
I was planning to give my official notice tomorrow

01:59.521 --> 02:06.153
Leaving behind all this hesitation and this sorrow

02:06.153 --> 02:12.463
I accept a new position that I have created myself

02:12.463 --> 02:16.313
Putting my own hard-earned dreams up on the shelf

02:16.313 --> 02:19.559
So I am gonna break away and stand!

02:19.559 --> 02:22.658
Gotta give it a try and take command!

02:22.658 --> 02:26.318
What that means is I am taking the wheel!

02:26.318 --> 02:29.228
