02:29.228 --> 02:31.962
Yes I am gonna break away and stand!

02:31.962 --> 02:35.615
Gotta give it a try and take command!

02:35.615 --> 02:38.743
What that means is I am taking the wheel!

02:38.743 --> 02:43.612
Making my dream into something so real!

02:43.612 --> 02:49.894
